---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import site from '../../data/site.json';

const effectiveDate = 'October 12, 2026';
const email = site.contact.email;
const hasGA = !!(site.analytics && site.analytics.ga4Id && site.analytics.ga4Id.startsWith('G-'));
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Giaccio Properties collects, uses, and protects the information you share with us."
>
  <section class="section alt">
    <div class="wrap legal">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>Effective {effectiveDate}</p>
      </div>

      <p>
        Giaccio Properties (&ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;us,&rdquo; or &ldquo;our&rdquo;) operates this website
        for homes across {site.contact.area}. This policy explains what information
        we collect when you visit the site or contact us, how we use it, and the choices you have. By
        using this website, you agree to the practices described here.
      </p>

      <h2>Information you give us</h2>
      <p>
        When you use our contact form, you choose to provide your name, email address, an optional phone
        number, an optional property you are interested in, and the message you write. We use this
        information only to respond to your inquiry and to discuss our homes with you. We do not require
        you to create an account, and we do not ask for financial, payment, or government-identification
        details through this website.
      </p>

      <h2>Information collected automatically</h2>
      <p>
        Like most websites, our host may record standard technical details when you visit, such as your
        browser type, device, approximate region, and the pages you view. This information helps keep the
        site secure and running properly.
      </p>

      {hasGA && (
        <>
          <h2>Analytics and cookies</h2>
          <p>
            We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use the site so we can improve it. Google
            Analytics sets cookies and may collect information such as your IP address (often truncated),
            device and browser details, and the pages you view. This data is aggregated and is not used by
            us to identify you personally. Google processes this information under its own terms; you can
            learn more at
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">policies.google.com/privacy</a>.
          </p>
          <p>
            You can opt out of Google Analytics across websites by installing the
            <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>,
            or by blocking cookies in your browser settings. We also honor the theme preference stored in
            your browser, which is used only to remember light or dark mode on your device.
          </p>
        </>
      )}

      <h2>How we use your information</h2>
      <p>
        We use the information above to respond to your inquiries, to communicate with you about our
        homes, to operate and secure the website, and to understand general site usage. We do not use it
        for automated decision-making.
      </p>

      <h2>Map and embedded content</h2>
      <p>
        Our contact page displays a map embedded from Google Maps. When that map loads, Google may receive
        information about your visit in accordance with its own privacy policy.
      </p>

      <h2>Sharing your information</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. We share it only with service providers
        that help us operate the website (such as our hosting and analytics providers), and only as needed
        for them to perform those services, or where required by law.
      </p>

      <h2>Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        We keep inquiry messages for as long as needed to respond to you and to maintain a record of our
        correspondence, after which we delete or archive them. Analytics data is retained according to our
        analytics provider&rsquo;s settings.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
      <p>
        You may ask us what information we hold about you, request that we correct or delete it, or ask us
        to stop contacting you, by emailing <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>. Depending on where you
        live, you may have additional rights under laws such as the California Consumer Privacy Act or the
        EU/UK General Data Protection Regulation; we will honor applicable requests.
      </p>

      <h2>Children&rsquo;s privacy</h2>
      <p>
        This website is intended for adults interested in our homes. We do not knowingly collect personal
        information from children under 13.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy from time to time. When we do, we will revise the effective date above.
        Significant changes will be reflected on this page.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy or your information can be sent to
        <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>{site.contact.address ? `, or by mail to ${site.contact.address}.` : '.'}
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
